/* The Services menu titles, keyed by the English strings the `NSMenuItem`
   `default` values in Info.plist carry. AppKit looks a service's menu title up
   in this file, in the bundle's localisation for the user's language, and falls
   back to the `default` in Info.plist when there is no entry — which is why the
   keys are those strings verbatim rather than identifiers, and why renaming one
   in Info.plist means renaming it in all eight of these. */
"New rulogman Window Here" = "Ouvrir une nouvelle fenêtre rulogman ici";
"New rulogman Tab Here" = "Ouvrir un nouvel onglet rulogman ici";
